msgid "Synfig Output"
msgstr "Synfig-utdata"

msgid "Synfig Animation written using the sif-file exporter extension"
msgstr "Synfig-animering skapad med exporttillägget sif-file"

msgid "Collection of SVG files One per root layer"
msgstr "Samling av SVG-filer, en per rotlager"

msgid "Each layer split into it's own svg file and collected as a tape archive (tar file)"
msgstr "Varje lager delas upp i en egen SVG-fil och samlas i ett bandarkiv (tar-fil)"

msgid "74mm x 52mm (A8)"
msgstr "74 mm × 52 mm (A8)"

msgid "85mm x 55mm (Europe)"
msgstr "85 mm × 55 mm (Europa)"

msgid "55mm x 55mm (Europe Square)"
msgstr "55 mm × 55 mm (Europa, kvadratisk)"

msgid "90mm x 55mm (Australia, India, ...)"
msgstr "90 mm × 55 mm (Australien, Indien, ...)"

msgid "91mm x 55mm (Japan)"
msgstr "91 mm × 55 mm (Japan)"

msgid "90mm x 54mm (China, ...)"
msgstr "90 mm × 54 mm (Kina, ...)"

msgid "90mm x 50mm (India, Russia, ...)"
msgstr "90 mm × 50 mm (Indien, Ryssland, ...)"

msgid "3.5in x 2in (US/Canada)"
msgstr "3,5 tum × 2 tum (USA/Kanada)"

msgid "2in x 2in (US Square)"
msgstr "2 tum × 2 tum (USA, kvadratisk)"

msgid "Normal (14mm)"
msgstr "Normal (14 mm)"

msgid "Tiled Canvas"
msgstr "Rutindelad rityta"

msgid "Sentence case"
msgstr "Meningsskiftläge"

msgid "Split Text"
msgstr "Dela text"

msgid "Split:"
msgstr "Dela efter:"

msgid "Threshold for separating manual kerns into words (multiples of font size)"
msgstr "Tröskelvärde för att dela upp manuellt justerade teckenmellanrum i ord (multiplar av teckenstorleken)"

msgid "This effect splits texts into different lines, words or letters."
msgstr "Denna effekt delar upp text i olika rader, ord eller bokstäver."

msgid "Doing so leads the text to lose a lot of its semantics. Only use this effect if you know what you're doing!"
msgstr "Då förlorar texten mycket av sin semantik. Använd endast denna effekt om du vet vad du gör!"

msgid "Note that the extension only uses a very rough estimate of the position of each word/letter. Text with different writing mode (e.g. tb-rl) is processed, but will be misaligned. Automatic line breaks in legacy flowtext (flowroot elements) are ignored."
msgstr "Observera att tillägget endast använder en mycket grov uppskattning av varje ords eller bokstavs position. Text med andra skrivlägen (t.ex. tb-rl) bearbetas, men blir feljusterad. Automatiska radbrytningar i äldre flödestext (flowroot-element) ignoreras."

msgid "Twirl"
msgstr "Virvel"

msgid "Amount of twirl:"
msgstr "Virvelstyrka:"

msgid "Deep Ungroup"
msgstr "Djupavgruppera"

msgid "Stopping Depth (from top)"
msgstr "Slutdjup (uppifrån)"

msgid "Depth to Keep (from bottom)"
msgstr "Djup att behålla (underifrån)"
